msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_DAE10AA8_CF55_4E6B_8531_40A384D97174"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Despite Michel’s assertions, the White-Haired Girl decided she would take up "
"residence within the mansion."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫尽管从米歇尔那受到了关于诅咒的警告，⟪k:3⟫但白发少女还是决定留在馆内。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_667912EF_7C4A_4A04_A635_6ED2F38EABC0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7ee564100ea3cff7371a43a8e69ad77561ae9cdc4e588a2048de8f3125136ce8
#. default-sha256: c50158c9ced887dd814e64518c0dc6000b776e9386ce18a683660abd4c51ddd2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_667912EF_7C4A_4A04_A635_6ED2F38EABC0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫This era’s White-Haired Girl was younger than the others; ⟪k:1⟫she was still in her early "
"teens, young enough to be seen as still a child."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫这个时代的她，⟪k:1⟫较之前的几个时代都要年轻——⟪k:2⟫目测只有十三、四岁的样子。⟪k:3⟫乍一看还只是"
"个孩子。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_D2425DFE_6D2B_4CFA_945A_6627E9588E3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6808d4af106dfb6a2af49ff8abc8f24780b9cbc6626c61d60b18e5d6f295364b
#. default-sha256: 1c06294ec0caefcaf30d53745485389bb4d61aea92a70b32824526a0ef33e0ec
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_D2425DFE_6D2B_4CFA_945A_6627E9588E3D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But she was neither as self-centered nor irresponsible as you might expect of someone her "
"age. ⟪k:1⟫She was very delicate and reserved, and acted with a great deal of modesty and "
"restraint."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫但少女身上却没有同龄人的任性和孩子气，⟪k:1⟫相反，她展现出与年龄不符的谦卑、⟪k:2⟫心细、稳重、"
"⟪k:3⟫谨慎、⟪k:4⟫以及善解人意。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_5F668DAB_F665_40A3_8C34_2A2FB0ACC034
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c7479b648b4d2e72c6b1d5e0c1bce932225738b919bf35892385333b9d3ffbac
#. default-sha256: d3700b001aaa7cf4fa80f77dd7d26fdd2bf1dcb97455cb12edf262fe79cf86ca
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_5F668DAB_F665_40A3_8C34_2A2FB0ACC034"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The accusations of her being a criminal and a sinner were grossly inappropriate."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这样一位少女，⟪k:1⟫与「犯人」、「罪人」这样的身份，⟪k:2⟫实在是相去甚远。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_3E99F111_B2C5_4066_BB9C_80997DD2F721
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab8489e56dcd4b94908784c0727937b3a992138ba72bc36033f549c32fad0adc
#. default-sha256: abb7375d0823d891801363173f07e64e0ccdf7782d43b214a1ab606692e0fc71
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3E99F111_B2C5_4066_BB9C_80997DD2F721"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nevertheless, she was still chased from her home, barely managing to flee to this mansion "
"with her life."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫但残酷的事实却是——⟪k:1⟫她被世人所追捕、⟪k:2⟫四处流亡、⟪k:3⟫为了活命才隐匿在这座馆。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_850175EC_D1E2_45B3_9009_E5E6C4FD45CF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1e577374addadd18c58d8e45302d0cbb9a08295930949a00dbbfdba64fce6bc0
#. default-sha256: 31c49707acf3984c87fcd6c0c634937131f075c76c76061a209a5c5bc158cc58
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_850175EC_D1E2_45B3_9009_E5E6C4FD45CF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now, the White-Haired Girl thought it would be rude to simply take up space in the mansion, "
"so she chased down the master, Michel,⟪k:1⟫and asked,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫现在，⟪k:1⟫这位白发少女——⟪k:2⟫或许是因为对无所事事地留在馆内而感到不好意思吧，⟪k:3⟫她拦住身为"
"馆主的米歇尔，⟪k:4⟫提出了请求——"

#: scenario4:scenario4_564B2023_C5DB_4394_B3B1_ABF82315653B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a8952fe514499f5d5375ebcb0289b1b9f578b8521a3475e804e0c8bc2bfbfaba
#. default-sha256: cd82dd5c5bb08eced61dd0e4088a9483705d2d473825205fb334db0b196ab2ae
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_564B2023_C5DB_4394_B3B1_ABF82315653B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Um... ⟪k:1⟫is there anything I can do to help?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I will clean or cook or do anything—"
"⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫just let me know."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫那个……⟪k:1⟫请问，⟪k:2⟫有什么我能做的事吗？⟪k:3⟫不管是清扫、⟪k:4⟫料理、⟪k:5⟫还是其他能帮上忙"
"的，⟪k:6⟫都请尽管吩咐……"

