msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I want to repay you for allowing me to stay here..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫您好心收留了我，⟪k:4⟫不报答的话实在是……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_5D5AB78C_0984_436E_A62A_E3D175B98131
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0adfb07eba671a07d9547ac6891c2295f46ba90e07081f5336d5879e711d21bf
