msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫You need not feel indebted to me.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫The weight of that obligation will only turn "
"into disdain."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……无妨，根本无需回报。⟪k:2⟫这份心意，⟪k:3⟫不久后也会变成恨意吧。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_5989BD40_9C21_4DF3_BC15_C6D54F5A1546
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: db56dbbb87c6becec4ae49719180976588f72b1fbc136d868fc75dd81c10a512
