#: scenario4:scenario4_1788B948_3811_48FC_969B_EFF9781C218B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8f8f80b99ad9835d9e24df1d0a68cf4756c4514e5411e56716bc3c76c30dcd7e
