#: scenario4:scenario4_93C197BB_AC1B_458A_8891_957752431C4C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af3d9f462122cb41bf81362afb1868d000507256f258d286b9616f0f88e77801
