msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_93C197BB_AC1B_458A_8891_957752431C4C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫…………"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C59BA84F_5331_4567_A82E_6BA83629ACDD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0059f2cccae2cf896ea51c06217507fde180c1cc4a4acfbdae2b37bcaf2cfaed
#. default-sha256: b12f9a5ba23b89c3aadeb8d5042f519c6abd2e64d389ba0d49c46700b27b3174
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C59BA84F_5331_4567_A82E_6BA83629ACDD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He said emotionlessly, turning away and walking off."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫米歇尔不带任何感情地说完这句话，⟪k:3⟫随即将视线移开，快步离开了。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C5865549_F44E_4E64_96BF_CA4EC9008A78
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab2bb06fef1fbeb37756b6273633672ddbedb9b666f3f203ebecca1d2f539b14
#. default-sha256: 6b2addff7f7d51370e1682881c8d6448949abf4906d0016d8721d31a53868d4e
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C5865549_F44E_4E64_96BF_CA4EC9008A78"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel was not, I believe, spurning her—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫he was merely disinterested. ⟪k:3⟫He did "
"not treat her disrespectfully, nor did he seem averse to her presence."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫这番话，⟪k:1⟫与其说是拒绝，倒更像是纯粹的毫无兴趣。⟪k:2⟫既非表达着冷酷，⟪k:3⟫也并非对她有所嫌"
"弃……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_EC91C502_9764_4B00_9534_C62C88A276DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ec8ba5bcea324d9d0df672f6ea161e69383f7ba95bcfebd56dcaf3c63bfcd570
#. default-sha256: 4385ba1bb0ce70305a8cba086b1800122cd685ce68dca46d849c9db56fce0422
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_EC91C502_9764_4B00_9534_C62C88A276DF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Words simply did not seem to affect him at all."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫只是，无论对他说什么，⟪k:1⟫也打动不了他的心。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_54050BD7_BD20_4F3F_89D2_ACF387428879
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d60824c14aa313070b86e8f7d02e069566de724fb6978ed38b60c3af6c3ec591
#. default-sha256: 71d51ea811737b73de3f2dc9ba0229278cc51db827ab843523286d405f9bf7a5
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_54050BD7_BD20_4F3F_89D2_ACF387428879"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Not only was the mansion a prison for his body, his body was also a prison ensnaring his "
"heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫如果说这座馆像一座牢狱，⟪k:1⟫那么青年的肉身也许也是一座牢笼。⟪k:2⟫为了封闭内部残存的心灵，"
"⟪k:3⟫而设的牢笼。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_7D6004BB_B5C1_46B7_A5CE_1F03430A4971
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c27187a4c4140d075d62fd7a1abeb2ea8532cb8b0253d49666daa1fb28f03042
#. default-sha256: a5f3773b68f0dc450930f16a275e113613fb29b0b71ca55d80c299b0e8e56179
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_7D6004BB_B5C1_46B7_A5CE_1F03430A4971"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫(I should still do whatever I can.)"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫（无论如何……只要有能做的事，⟪k:1⟫都必须尽力而为）"

#: scenario4:scenario4_C646BDA3_4462_4C88_B7FF_B8279C83B0D4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9ec13a48bb86e7e94678f8143c5128ec6947af59d75135bbe2ce430215af5474
#. default-sha256: af1922cfa9f2e044246a777245f95831369c1fea04df0e917c4c5573e291e7bc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_C646BDA3_4462_4C88_B7FF_B8279C83B0D4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But she did not let that get her down. ⟪k:1⟫In fact, she might have even interpreted his "
"disinterest as kindness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫但是，⟪k:1⟫少女没有放弃。⟪k:2⟫倒不如说，⟪k:3⟫也许对她而言，⟪k:4⟫甚至连米歇尔这种毫不关心的态"
"度，都让她感到了一丝温柔。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_13131F31_9A42_41A0_9E64_6EA53DC69456
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a83fb089b3fc5694825ee0ea612f9e7cfa5c2af029f53aa2e5c955b258889b0
#. default-sha256: a2f01ab5a05c5d864e20d06f203f6b9a17d31e4398cbd1d80652dab7a49085b9
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_13131F31_9A42_41A0_9E64_6EA53DC69456"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though he was a bit standoffish, he did not attempt to cause her harm. ⟪k:1⟫He was nothing "
"like the people who had accused her of being a witch and forced her to flee for her life."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫米歇尔虽然态度漠然，⟪k:1⟫但却无意加害于她。⟪k:2⟫这与那些围攻、追捕她的人截然不同。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_40245605_7D13_496B_AAB5_8DF61CBD11F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 211a4724f1bcf386bd6a28e4e9c0fbccd3f32a4d9bb7b55ad003f6edcfc10a99
#. default-sha256: b91d78b157fc0ec9e943fadfcc7a6f5bf7cf84881f13f294dbac14085bf480e4
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_40245605_7D13_496B_AAB5_8DF61CBD11F2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And she was deeply grateful for that."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫所以在少女看来，⟪k:1⟫这已经是非常值得庆幸的事了。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_3C7A6950_6D50_412E_B0FA_7756486CE3C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ceacc3031f6b95063237ba2465f25f78d8b9c05f3e00e4581ded94917988df0
#. default-sha256: e6be1b7d226a9c6866951a88700c7018da3cb6a6197810b0e50d03dc6b9755c2
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_3C7A6950_6D50_412E_B0FA_7756486CE3C5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Thus began their quiet life together—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Michel, who avoided contact with others, "
"and the White-Haired Girl, who had taken a great deal of abuse from others."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫拒绝与人接触的米歇尔，⟪k:2⟫被人所虐待的白发少女。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6D41E979_C176_416B_9A55_48944A13EFCE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 62b57a0c4ee12e0f5934573cf8f435a4b66838433718c10275a5fbf5b01fdb0f
#. default-sha256: e75e66d927a750bdb8a5f6a4719f1a426951de20eef7bd2c105eb28c018f7770
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6D41E979_C176_416B_9A55_48944A13EFCE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Two people who knew hardly anything about one another—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫who were too distant to "
"really be said to be living “together.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫二人的生活，⟪k:1⟫就这么静悄悄地拉开了序幕。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫对彼此一无所知的两人住在一起，⟪k:4⟫甚至"
"不能说是「同居」。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_AB6ABACB_5661_491D_B2AC_B361299E2335
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ed5c268bb0745ef16f8eba955a59924b7f59566ce7fa0454741193fe1e460d7f
#. default-sha256: 3b7f35975fd84eee9dc54ca9414c2f627b8f819597394e441786fecd16bd1ea7
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AB6ABACB_5661_491D_B2AC_B361299E2335"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Michel spent most of his day in his chambers, so they only ever saw each other occasionally, "
"and they hardly ever spoke."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫米歇尔每天大部分的时间，都把自己关在卧室里。⟪k:1⟫纵使两人偶尔见面，也基本相顾无言。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_57099ACB_C553_4EC9_955F_FAA781ED6BC2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9f530fb5b9791303d309d4a1ff74abcea44ad95543a74ab1eec639a3b038fa66
#. default-sha256: 58d151dcc844219fb252c44fc3d633d78c544e6a9520daa7fa02d05c09d175ca
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_57099ACB_C553_4EC9_955F_FAA781ED6BC2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Though they stayed in the same house,⟪k:1⟫they both still lived solitary lives."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫即使处在同一屋檐下，⟪k:1⟫却各自守着自己的孤独度日……"

#: scenario4:scenario4_2279AA0A_4CF2_4489_AA22_A8D2847C68CD
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dd691ed7bc9c7fcddc4899fcbb178fe26e3f1a5c7d1af106582516fa63f89eb0
#. default-sha256: d4abec1a79cb7fadebca80358ec831ade5dbfaf644b3ae81ccf0ce4f9813cd41
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_2279AA0A_4CF2_4489_AA22_A8D2847C68CD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, the White-Haired Girl wanted to get to know Michel better."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫话虽如此，⟪k:1⟫实际上，白发少女有些好奇米歇尔的身世。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_6F15CC23_D3F5_4FEC_993D_333844D58D28
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2353b1670605d93f44f45bec7c24e70c3a880a6389cc94403fd4acb2669b8ac2
#. default-sha256: 7979efdc58c2a56eb487800ffb4b67036bfd7f1c69f3e68a0f06d45f955f1e58
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_6F15CC23_D3F5_4FEC_993D_333844D58D28"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She wanted to know why he called himself cursed,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫为何他要自称「被诅咒着」呢？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_BE41FC56_496B_4165_A681_048D619EEEF0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e8a000a9442f211ba99df921a6f1ec33de24b68883953282f93e5b26ba0b293
#. default-sha256: 0684a712775a7e053095ba724d1b141d8bffa3ecba23e5ae43f5c34bc1a01666
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_BE41FC56_496B_4165_A681_048D619EEEF0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫why... ⟪k:1⟫he lived alone in this dark mansion,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫又为何……⟪k:1⟫要独自一人，⟪k:2⟫守在这座黑暗无光的馆里呢？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_56924B05_D029_4EF7_86C2_FBCF3E8ECDB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f0d910faab92e230c49e72cce0e8d87a7077ee064a1053473c8e06e4ed40f748
#. default-sha256: b1efd1ccf55d56d4b75a335fbc7c87f840bb032278b4b5d3a5071239e825c0bc
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_56924B05_D029_4EF7_86C2_FBCF3E8ECDB0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫how many days, how many years he had spent here in solitude."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫像这样孤零零的生活，⟪k:1⟫已经有几天？⟪k:2⟫还是几年了呢？"

#: scenario4:scenario4_02943C5C_88AC_4B7C_9445_C1E7DDA92F8E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c6558a9e1b5bb12ad1b27d2edd5059d09c948a992255acb9de8c3cf6207d674
#. default-sha256: 6e4567664eeb20feb1a5d771ef29c7c99af09609899b1b23a6f3b980d22aea0f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_02943C5C_88AC_4B7C_9445_C1E7DDA92F8E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And while she waited for the opportunity, she also started doing things around the house."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫少女一边寻思着交流的机会，⟪k:1⟫一边自顾自地、⟪k:2⟫开始处理力所能及的事。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_FEAE5476_5E22_4BE2_B5CE_EBB1071EF666
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6ab32fbfd9dc37def279175f225b390a98ee47991cfed63de9180c39f3c04ad6
#. default-sha256: 9ae2e704d159f620130f602b49d2f4d5fe54882d174eca937fb6febe8cefe84f
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_FEAE5476_5E22_4BE2_B5CE_EBB1071EF666"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The first project she set out to take care of was cleaning. ⟪k:2⟫As the windows were "
"all firmly shut, her only source of light was candles."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫最开始时，⟪k:2⟫她从打扫房间做起。⟪k:3⟫但由于每扇窗都很难打开，⟪k:4⟫少女只能用烛火照明。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_E96CF4DB_B15B_4BF1_ADC2_C15D8B247304
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c00fecae6b96368c5e50f9561ee8d663b528a3a98cd30b226eb7259ebfa3601b
#. default-sha256: 24044270e4ad1c231c17ee7636bd8f992ff627d8249bde1a6e6732db53fec196
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_E96CF4DB_B15B_4BF1_ADC2_C15D8B247304"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For whatever reason, there was a great deal of candles stored in the cellar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫仓库里残留着大量的蜡烛。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_B3569F31_3996_4693_8CB4_72193079A5B7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7176200bd6d61825a862d406c82bb46d330ec2b06c62e410503954539e1fadd8
#. default-sha256: 5e9ea1c1abc33ff63cf3b549fa56542f11aeb8d65154121babc1df3d22117869
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_B3569F31_3996_4693_8CB4_72193079A5B7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She wondered where on earth he had acquired so many, but she never found the opportunity to "
"ask him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫她有些不解——⟪k:1⟫这些物资到底是从哪里运来的呢？⟪k:2⟫却又迟迟没能找到向青年提出疑问的机会。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_790671EB_16E3_4500_8067_C875CA673253
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2fa7c502b8a642d6d55921ff8130414be21faac619599fa09f151ec6cb96e8d
#. default-sha256: 4a179287c785a6cfa75720480c0cf19de86defab8d6a70afcde7551c5024b169
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_790671EB_16E3_4500_8067_C875CA673253"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was difficult to even see all the dust and cobwebs with only candlelight, and considering "
"the poor airflow through the house, she was afraid her efforts were going to be in vain."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫蜡烛发出的微弱光亮无法令人看清灰尘。⟪k:1⟫加之在封闭的馆内，空气流动也很糟糕。⟪k:2⟫这使得打扫"
"变得几乎没有意义。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_73075EBA_6725_4B69_BE7A_FC90071FF6BE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c1bb217213bb189a84bad53ce4b96dfc1e17f2e7211f5c38adf7e525b770bbbb
#. default-sha256: 70720bc78e93548a9b4427d4862dc29fb68249ad6d1fed8415ac4a4729acedc1
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_73075EBA_6725_4B69_BE7A_FC90071FF6BE"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Still she persisted, sweeping and wiping things down, one room at a time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫尽管如此，⟪k:1⟫少女还是决意满满地，⟪k:2⟫一边清扫、一边擦拭，⟪k:3⟫踏踏实实地忙碌了起来。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_A9B09618_AA36_4C3F_8C7A_ECABE6D861FF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60a1942730d29924d7a1d692778f169d79c8d1396dfac06e11446feafc368a6d
#. default-sha256: 725847644ece8b98ecb1f8aa366561bb30796cca5864d1d32757fa69280880a0
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_A9B09618_AA36_4C3F_8C7A_ECABE6D861FF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eventually, she made her way to the library.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The dust that had settled there was "
"much heavier than in any other room; ⟪k:3⟫with each breath, she had to fight back coughs."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫不久后她来到了一间屋子，⟪k:1⟫那里看架势像是书库。⟪k:2⟫屋里的粉尘味尤为严重，⟪k:3⟫以至于连呼吸"
"都会被呛到。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_1ED3589A_04FC_4AA7_9181_C7023BD6EA65
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bc1c6e2f9c34ce902976e2e4628fd0c91635773730e7bee744746f6293d93231
#. default-sha256: 4a8f98de8c52fde5179199248db2a01debebf61adf731f63093881c429b9a25b
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_1ED3589A_04FC_4AA7_9181_C7023BD6EA65"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was not a room one would normally be comfortable spending much time in, but the sight of "
"so many bulky volumes lining the shelves sent her heart aflutter with delight."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫正常情况下，谁都无法长时间忍受这种环境……⟪k:1⟫但此刻的少女，⟪k:2⟫望着书架上一册册厚重的书卷，"
"⟪k:3⟫反而心中涌起一阵激动。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_AD3E8AC4_00BA_4D0A_A64F_22B99EEF6A3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8096072a303cc8ed72e03e502c9aeb2464d0067fa14d861bf84fba5afdee9da0
#. default-sha256: 5b3754626daa20deac669b915741b47c99561fbde9c6563772ab4da5d7ff4c41
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_AD3E8AC4_00BA_4D0A_A64F_22B99EEF6A3D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They’re... ⟪k:1⟫books.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Incredible... ⟪k:4⟫Real books."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫这些……⟪k:1⟫全都是书呢。⟪k:2⟫好厉害……⟪k:3⟫是真正的书呢。"

#: scenario4:scenario4_38886115_8108_4B46_86B1_0AA90E57CCA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 039c8620e5034782c5650629ca9109f4f68069b01d782b3c43185a1f36a93645
#. default-sha256: 382d62ea49ad861e6086e20e136d6a68006868e20f33d7878d2eacf896b5ebce
msgctxt "scenario4:scenario4_38886115_8108_4B46_86B1_0AA90E57CCA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The White-Haired Girl had never seen a book before. ⟪k:1⟫She had heard people describe them, "
"but that was the first time she had ever seen one for herself."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫是的，⟪k:1⟫少女之前从未亲眼见过「书」这种东西。⟪k:2⟫仅仅是曾听人谈及而已，⟪k:3⟫这是她第一次亲"
"眼见到实物。"

