msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She hoped she had not damaged any of her host’s valuable collection, for the mess was enough "
"of a setback already in her attempt to express her gratitude."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫淹没在书海里的她，⟪k:1⟫瞬间慌了手脚。⟪k:2⟫如果不慎弄坏了如此贵重的书籍的话，⟪k:3⟫别说是报恩，"
"分明就是在添乱了啊。"

